    "result_text": "AcceptanceTest is the only test class, and the full suite is green.\n\nDone. The change adds an `initials` field to the owner GET response.\n\n**What I changed (2 files):**\n1. `src/main/resources/openapi.yml` \u2014 added a read-only `initials` property to the `Owner` schema, right beside the existing `displayName` (regenerates `OwnerDto`).\n2. `mapper/OwnerMapper.java` \u2014 added one `@Mapping` expression on `toOwnerDto` computing `firstName[0].toUpperCase() + \".\" + lastName[0].toUpperCase() + \".\"`, so `\"john\"`/`\"smith\"` \u2192 `\"J.S.\"`.\n\nI mirrored the existing `displayName` pattern rather than adding a method to the large `Owner` entity, keeping structural impact minimal: the mapper's `toOwnerDto` is a zero-body abstract method with tiny surrounding complexity, and no function body was grown. `AcceptanceTest` and the full suite pass.",
